{"meta":{"id":"java-db-statement","category":"it/programming-languages/java","title":"JAVA DB 통신 속도 비교","subtitle":"","summary":"Statement와 PreparedStatement의 속도 비교","tags":["java","jdbc","statement","preparedstatement","성능"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"blog: code/back/JAVA_DBStatement_TT.jsx","updatedAt":"2023-09-15"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2023-09-15</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">JAVA DB 통신 속도 비교</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Statement와 PreparedStatement의 속도 비교</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">JAVA 교육받을 때, Statement와 PreparedStatement의 성능 비교가 해봤습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">테스트 1. Statement와 PreparedStatement의 생성된 후 반복</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">50회까지 Statement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">200회부터 PreparedStatement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">테스트 2. Statement와 PreparedStatement의 생성 포함 반복</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">200회까지 Statement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">500회부터 PreparedStatement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">*트래픽과 성능 비교는 python(locust)를 사용하고 있습니다.(기준 2025-06-06)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Statement와 PreparedStatement를 배우고 PreparedStatement가 속도가 엄청 더 빠르다고 하길래 얼마나 빠른지 궁금해서 속도를 비교해봤습니다. 하지만, 결과는 Statement가 더 빨랐습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그래서 반복 횟수가 부족하구나 싶어서 반복 횟수를 늘리면서 테스트를 해봤습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">쿼리 동작하는 부분만 반복문으로 돌려서 비교해보니 50회까지는 무조건 Statement가 빠르고 100회부터는 Statement가 빠른 경우가 더 많지만 PreparedStatement가 빠른 케이스도 섞여서 나왔습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">150회부터는 PreparedStatement가 빠른 케이스가 훨씬 많아졌고 200회부터는 PreparedStatement가 무조건 빨랐습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그러다가 문뜩 쿼리를 생성하는 영역이 PreparedStatement는 빠져있는 게 맞는가?라는 생각이 들고</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">PreparedStatement와 Statement 생성하는것도 넣고 비교해봤습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그랬더니 200회까지는 Statement가 빠르고 300회부터 PreparedStatement가 빠른 케이스가 생기고 500회가 넘으면 PreparedStatement가 더 빨랐습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-800 font-semibold\">결과를 보고나니, 접속 인원 100명 이하가 되는 소규모 서버에서는 SQL Injection 방지하는 함수나 정규식을 넣는다고 가정하면, Statement가 더 낫지않을까? 라는 생각이 들었습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">아는 형이랑 이야기하다보니,소규모면 PreparedStatement가 조금 비효율적이라도 어차피 트래픽이 많지 않아서 상관없겠다라는 결론이 나왔습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">반복 횟수를 늘리는 거랑 트래픽이랑 연관이 있을 거라고 생각했는데</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">지금보니, 단순 반복으로는 정상적인 테스트가 안 될 것같고 최소한 쓰레드를 사용해서 병렬처리로 테스트하는 게 조금 더 나을 것같습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그리고 이렇게 테스트하는 것보다 그냥 실제 트래픽 테스트를 하면됩니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">테스트 1. Statement와 PreparedStatement의 생성된 후 반복</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">해당 구문 두개를 반복 동작하며 로그 확인</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><a href=\"/assets/text/contents/log_2023-09-15_stmt_pstmt_생성포함X.log\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-orange-700 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2\">log_2023-09-15_stmt_pstmt_생성포함X.log 다운로드</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">50회까지 Statement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">200회부터 PreparedStatement가 빠름</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">ResultSet rs = stmt1.executeQuery(sql);</pre></div>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">pstmt.setString(1, strName);\r\npstmt.executeQuery();</pre></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">테스트 2. Statement와 PreparedStatement의 생성 포함 반복</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">해당 구문 두개를 반복 동작하며 로그 확인</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><a href=\"/assets/text/contents/log_2023-09-15_stmt_pstmt_생성포함O.log\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-orange-700 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2\">log_2023-09-15_stmt_pstmt_생성포함O.log 다운로드</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">200회까지 Statement가 빠름</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">500회부터 PreparedStatement가 빠름</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">Statement stmt1 = conn.createStatement();\r\n\r\nString sql = String.format(&quot;select * from %s where name = &#x27;%s&#x27;&quot;,strTable , strName);\r\nResultSet rs = stmt1.executeQuery(sql);\r\n\r\nstmt1 = null;\r\n    //stmt1.close();</pre></div>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql);\r\npstmt.setString(1, strName);\r\npstmt.executeQuery();</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/programming-languages/java/java-db-statement","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"programming-languages","title":"프로그램 언어","path":"it/programming-languages"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/programming-languages/java"}],"hasImage":false}